 "answer": {
  "text": "Marvel Comics created more superheroes than DC Comics. Computing (count of DC Comics heroes) minus (count of Marvel Comics heroes) yields a negative number, indicating DC Comics has fewer heroes than Marvel Comics; the magnitude of this difference is the answer returned by the query.",
  "sql": "SELECT\n  SUM(CASE WHEN p.publisher_name = 'DC Comics' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)\n  - SUM(CASE WHEN p.publisher_name = 'Marvel Comics' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS difference\nFROM superhero s\nJOIN publisher p ON s.publisher_id = p.id\nWHERE p.publisher_name IN ('DC Comics', 'Marvel Comics');",
